sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor User as User Browser
    participant UI as Web Frontend
    participant API as FastAPI Backend
    participant Queue as Async Job Manager
    participant Engine as ARDY Engine
    participant Denoiser as PyTorch CUDA Denoiser
    participant Tokenizer as ARDY Tokenizer
    participant Adapter as VRM Retargeter

    User->>UI: Input prompt + duration & click Generate
    UI->>API: POST /api/generations { prompt, duration_seconds }
    API->>Queue: Enqueue job & create task
    API-->>UI: 200 OK { job_id, status: "queued" }
    UI->>API: Connect WS /api/generations/{job_id}/events

    Queue->>Engine: Run generation (prompt, duration)
    Queue-->>UI: WS Event: status="processing", step="encoding_prompt"
    Engine->>Engine: Encode prompt to [B, 32, 4096] condition
    Queue-->>UI: WS Event: status="processing", step="diffusion_denoiser"
    Engine->>Denoiser: Run flow matching diffusion on GPU
    Denoiser-->>Engine: Latent motion tokens
    Queue-->>UI: WS Event: status="processing", step="decoding_tokenizer"
    Engine->>Tokenizer: Decode latents to [T, 27, 3, 3] rotation matrices
    Tokenizer-->>Engine: Reconstructed rotations & root translations
    Queue-->>UI: WS Event: status="processing", step="retargeting_vrm"
    Engine->>Adapter: Compute FK & map to VRM 1.0 humanoid bones
    Adapter-->>Engine: UnifiedMotionPayload (skeleton + VRM + telemetry)
    Engine-->>Queue: Generation complete
    Queue-->>UI: WS Event: status="completed", result=payload

    UI->>UI: Update Skeleton 3D & VRM 3D & Telemetry HUD
    UI-->>User: Synchronized playback starts
